+
+\subsection{Alternative Objectives}
+The present paper optimizes a rare-positive, low-FPR objective. The same EI machinery can chase other reviewable KPIs: group-level false-alarm rate, time-to-first-detection, calibration under distribution shift, phase-balanced recall, worst-family false-alarm burden, cross-seed stability, or a cost-weighted utility that penalizes single-bird, RC, and weather false alarms differently. These are future benchmark objectives; they are not retroactively optimized in the present holdout claim.
